Release: 0.64.0

One-time request to build and publish the universal Android APK using the
existing GitHub Actions private signing configuration and full release gates.

Safety conditions:
- Source tests, Flutter analysis/tests, Kotlin regression checks and APK
  verification must all pass on the exact publish commit.
- Certificate SHA-256 must match the installed v0.63.0 release.
- Missing private signing configuration must fail without creating a release.
- Never publish the temporary candidate APK as an installable update.
